WEBVTT

00:08:58.493 --> 00:09:02.143
It's always, as Karl Popper put it,

00:09:02.167 --> 00:09:03.643
theory-laden.

00:09:04.746 --> 00:09:07.638
Scientific knowledge
isn't derived from anything.

00:09:07.662 --> 00:09:11.751
Like all knowledge,
it's conjectural, guesswork,

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:15.240
tested by observation,

00:09:15.264 --> 00:09:17.335
not derived from it.

00:09:19.093 --> 00:09:22.119
So, were testable conjectures
the great innovation

00:09:22.143 --> 00:09:25.976
that opened the intellectual prison gates?

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:31.086
No, contrary to what's usually said,
testability is common